      "en": "When Athaliah heard the noise of the people running and praising the king, she came to the people into the LORD’s house.",
      "ko": "아달랴가 백성들이 분주하며 왕을 찬송하는 소리를 듣고 여호와의 전에 들어가서 백성에게 이르러",
      "source_text_hash": "5959e0304ded2f1224d2ceeb109ca3e86cfdfc2f16f40443f71fb1e794b76e41",
      "translation_text_hash": "3d2b822ab48e742a00df5394381abf3c879d8ffaf0aec5f576de9febf0094364",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
