      "en": "So they made way for her. She went to the entrance of the horse gate to the king’s house; and they killed her there.",
      "ko": "이에 무리가 길을 열어 주고 저가 왕궁 마문 어귀에 이를 때에 거기서 죽였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "fc5415538112ffdc6ead8975207efe0099174c4414cb878b6f70031f06e21023",
